1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,519
I'm just arriving to visit one of my favorite couples, favorite families in the entire world.

2
00:00:05,660 --> 00:00:10,539
I'm so excited to introduce this family to you guys as a brand new episode of Free Human.

3
00:00:11,330 --> 00:00:16,879
You're going to be blown away by the type of lifestyle that this family has and the way that they've curated it.

4
00:00:17,039 --> 00:00:18,039
It's just magic.

5
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:19,940
So stick around to find out more.

6
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:24,399
Welcome to another episode of Free Human starring my buddy Shanksy.

7
00:00:25,019 --> 00:00:28,940
Most people think adventure ends when you start our family, not for the adventurous Aaron.

8
00:00:29,460 --> 00:00:31,839
He spent decades traveling the world, climbing mountains,

9
00:00:32,159 --> 00:00:36,579
surfing empty beaches and saying yes to almost every adventure life has offered him.

10
00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:41,740
Today with his partner, he's raising twin girls on an off-grid property he built with his own hands,

11
00:00:42,060 --> 00:00:44,420
proving you don't have to choose between freedom and family.

12
00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:46,780
This isn't just a story about off-grid living.

13
00:00:47,060 --> 00:00:49,640
It's about building a life you don't have to wait to live.

14
00:00:50,100 --> 00:00:51,039
What does freedom mean to you?

15
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:57,100
Having the constant opportunity to express who I truly am.

16
00:00:58,200 --> 00:01:06,900
Yeah, without limitations, without holding back, without having to be someone I'm not

17
00:01:08,120 --> 00:01:11,420
and being able to do the things that I want to do.

